{{ define "subject" }}New Fellow Application: {{.FullName}}{{ end }}

{{ define "plainBody" }}
Dear Administrator,

A new fellow application has been submitted and is waiting for your review.

Applicant: {{.FullName}}
Email: {{.ApplicantEmail}}
Organization: {{.Organization}}
Subjects: {{.Subjects}}
Grade Levels: {{.GradeLevels}}
Years of Experience: {{.ExperienceYears}}

Please log in to the 501 STEAM Hub to review this application.

